# Sprint AI-126B Final PAT (Cross Device Validation): real Supabase Project
# URL / anon-publishable key, developer/Project-Owner-local override of
# js/data/SupabaseConfig.js's committed blank placeholder — this repository
# is Public, so real project-specific values must never be committed, even
# though the anon/publishable key is designed by Supabase itself to be safe
# to ship to a browser (RLS is the real protection). See
# js/data/SupabaseConfig.js's own header for the load-precedence.
js/data/SupabaseConfig.local.js

# Sprint AI-116 QA Automation Framework: Playwright's own run output
# (HTML report, test-results, ad-hoc screenshots) is ephemeral CI
# artifact, regenerated every run and uploaded by
# .github/workflows/playwright.yml — never committed. The baseline
# images under playwright/tests/*-snapshots/ (AI-116-06 Screenshot
# Regression) ARE committed — this ignore is scoped to /playwright/report/
# only, not the whole playwright/ directory.
/playwright/report/html/
/playwright/report/test-results/
/playwright/report/screenshots/
/playwright/report/results.json
